      "Confirm medium viscosity (0.9-1.1e-3 Pa·s) — the 4.0 µL/min flow assumes 1e-3 Pa·s.",
      "Check that the syringe pump can deliver 4.0 µL/min stably (low-flow pulsation may require a dampener).",
